 "defect_observations": [
  "C016 (thm:p15-posterior-mean-consistency, parts 256-270) states the noise mean as \"known\"; Durrett Ex. 4.6.1 (p. 248) assumes only E|Z_i| finite. The mean is fixed by the law, so the word is harmless, but it is an added qualifier relative to the source wording.",
  "C017 (thm:p15-extinction-or-escape, parts 272-295) uses thresholds delta_K for positive integers K where Durrett Ex. 4.6.4 (p. 249) uses delta(x) for real x; the handbook hypothesis is implied by the source one, so the source variant is covered.",
  "Parts lines 357-363 (after C021) point Section 4.7 applications to sec:p15-exchangeability-and-definetti and P17 theorems; those are outside these 21 components and the targets exist."
 ],
